{
 "scene": 3,
 "id": "s03",
 "type": "image",
 "dataDuration": 105.833,
 "srcSlideHtml": "/home/ubuntu/blog2video/blog2video-output/steering-claude-code/slide_3.html",
 "topbarIndex": "[03/12]",
 "subtitles": [
  {
   "id": "sub-1",
   "localStart": 0,
   "localDuration": 2.491,
   "text": "先说大家最熟的 CLAUDE.md。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-2",
   "localStart": 2.491,
   "localDuration": 8.027,
   "text": "它是项目根目录下的一个 markdown 文件，开 session 的时候自动加载，整个 session 全程常驻。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-3",
   "localStart": 10.518,
   "localDuration": 2.768,
   "text": "压缩对话之后还会重新读一遍——它不会丢。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-4",
   "localStart": 13.428,
   "localDuration": 1.873,
   "text": "正因为它不会丢，它就特别贵。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-5",
   "localStart": 15.301,
   "localDuration": 1.606,
   "text": "每一行都全程占着上下文。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-6",
   "localStart": 16.907,
   "localDuration": 9.633,
   "text": "所以官方给了一条非常硬的建议：**CLAUDE.md 保持在 200 行以内，给它指定一个 owner，每次改动都要像改代码一样 review。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-7",
   "localStart": 26.54,
   "localDuration": 0.267,
   "text": "**"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-8",
   "localStart": 26.964,
   "localDuration": 1.991,
   "text": "200 行是什么概念？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-9",
   "localStart": 28.955,
   "localDuration": 8.147,
   "text": "基本就是装项目骨架——构建命令、目录结构、monorepo 怎么划分、团队的代码风格规范。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-10",
   "localStart": 37.102,
   "localDuration": 5.25,
   "text": "这种\"全程都要知道\"的事实，才配住进 CLAUDE.md。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-11",
   "localStart": 42.516,
   "localDuration": 1.602,
   "text": "那不该住这里的是什么？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-12",
   "localStart": 44.118,
   "localDuration": 2.038,
   "text": "官方给了三个非常清晰的信号。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-13",
   "localStart": 46.156,
   "localDuration": 6.407,
   "text": "第一，**写了 30 行的部署流程**——那是 procedure，该搬去 skill。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-14",
   "localStart": 52.704,
   "localDuration": 6.93,
   "text": "第二，**写了\"每次 X 之后都要 Y\"**——那是确定性自动化，该搬去 hook。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-15",
   "localStart": 59.634,
   "localDuration": 7.424,
   "text": "第三，**写了\"永远不要做 X\"**——那不是护栏，是 wishful thinking。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-16",
   "localStart": 67.212,
   "localDuration": 3.237,
   "text": "官方还提了一个特别实用的设计。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-17",
   "localStart": 70.449,
   "localDuration": 3.453,
   "text": "CLAUDE.md 可以分两种。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-18",
   "localStart": 73.902,
   "localDuration": 3.237,
   "text": "根目录那个是常驻型，全程加载。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-19",
   "localStart": 77.139,
   "localDuration": 7.121,
   "text": "但子目录里也可以放，比如 `app/api/CLAUDE.md`。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-20",
   "localStart": 84.42,
   "localDuration": 7.08,
   "text": "这种是按需型——只有当 Claude 真的去读 `app/api` 下面的文件时，它才加载。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-21",
   "localStart": 91.5,
   "localDuration": 2.154,
   "text": "不读那个目录，它就一直休眠。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-22",
   "localStart": 93.816,
   "localDuration": 3.255,
   "text": "在 monorepo 里，这招特别关键。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-23",
   "localStart": 97.071,
   "localDuration": 5.209,
   "text": "每个团队管自己的子目录，自己的规矩只在动到自己代码时才进上下文。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-24",
   "localStart": 102.28,
   "localDuration": 3.417,
   "text": "前端工程师不用为后端的规矩付 token。"
  }
 ]
}